      "name": "Mappings",
      "description": {
        "content": "Endpoints for managing external system mappings. Mappings link Teambridge records\nto entities in external systems (like Bullhorn, ADP, etc.) by storing the external\nprovider code, external ID, and object type.\n",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
